# Principals for the new domain, used by 06-map-principals.sh.
# Copy to principals.csv and edit. One row per user or group; no spaces around commas.
#
# kind      user | group
# name      sAMAccountName in the new domain (e.g. devuser, Kernel Developers)
# source_sid  optional: SID of the matching principal in the SOURCE domain, as
#             printed on 04-import-gpos.sh "REVIEW: source-domain SID" lines.
#             Find it on the source domain with:
#               (Get-ADGroup 'Kernel Developers').SID.Value
# members   groups only: new-domain users, separated by ';'
# password  users only: optional; a random one is generated and printed if empty
#
kind,name,source_sid,members,password
user,devuser,,,
user,devlead,,,
group,Kernel Developers,S-1-5-21-1111111111-2222222222-3333333333-1105,devuser;devlead,
